# scripts/review-knowledge/corpus holds documents fetched from external
# standards bodies, vendors and language teams. They are third-party material
# checked in for reproducibility, not this repository's source, and they build
# their own separate retrieval corpus. Marking them vendored keeps them out of
# GitHub's language statistics and out of tx's code index, where prose about
# code review otherwise outranks the code that implements it.
scripts/review-knowledge/corpus/** linguist-vendored
